flag provided but not defined: -config
Usage of bifrost:
  -heavy
    	include heavy (yggdrasil) cases
  -impls string
    	comma-separated subset of impls to drive
  -json
    	emit machine-readable JSON
  -list
    	list impls + cases and exit
  -only string
    	run only these cases (comma-separated)
  -shake
    	diff standalone artifacts per target (deploy-path parity)
  -suite string
    	run a project's bifrost.suite.json instead of the corpus
